<title>USA: HF Ahmanson names Twomey as vice-chairman.</title>
<headline>HF Ahmanson names Twomey as vice-chairman.</headline>
<dateline>IRWINDALE, Calif. 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>H.F. Ahmanson &amp; Co said Tuesday it has appointed Chief Financial Officer Kevin Twomey to the new position of vice chairman.</p>
<p>Twomey, who joined the company in 1993, will also retain his duties chief financial officer. Twomey's addition to the board brings the total number of Ahmanson board members to 14.</p>
</text>
